When filing a Form I-140 and Form I-485 together, do not combine your supporting documents. We recommend assembling each form package in the following order:
- Form I-140
 - Form G-1450, Authorization for Credit Card Transactions; Form G-1650, Authorization for ACH Transactions; or Form G-1651, Exemption for Paper Fee Payment with a check or money order;
 - Form G-1145, Request for e-Notification (if applicable);
 - Form G-28 (if applicable);
 - Form I-140; and
 - Supporting documentation. - Form I-485
 - Form G-1450, Authorization for Credit Card Transactions; Form G-1650, Authorization for ACH Transactions; or Form G-1651, Exemption for Paper Fee Payment with a check or money order;
 - Form G-1145, Request for e-Notification (if applicable);
 - Form G-28 (if applicable);
 - Form I-485; and
 - Supporting documentation.

